  "narrative": "The independent validation for H43 strongly supports the corrected feature_010 association. In the discovery analysis, feature_010=1 versus 0 had a signed estimate of +0.829 composite dependency-score units (95% CI +0.767 to +0.891), and the independent validation gives +0.766 with an independent interval of +0.678 to +0.855. Both estimates and their lower bounds are far above the 0.15-unit effect-size threshold in the claimed positive direction, and the intervals are compatible. I therefore accept H43 and close the exact marginal investigation for feature_010: in this supplied dataset, feature_010=1 is associated with a substantially higher, i.e. less negative, composite dependency score. I also close the exact marginal investigation for H27 because feature_002 has already been independently validated: discovery signed effect +0.810 (95% CI +0.745 to +0.875), independent validation +0.784 (independent interval +0.697 to +0.871). The supported dataset-specific signal set now includes feature_002=1 associated with higher outcome_001, feature_010=1 associated with higher outcome_001, and feature_037=1 associated with lower outcome_001 (H44 signed discovery effect +0.804 relative to its claimed negative-direction hypothesis). The conditional robustness tests are also supportive: each of these associations persists in complements of the other strong flags and within feature_038 >= 0.5, although feature_040 and formal interaction evidence remain unresolved. Negative findings include the named binary markers feature_007, feature_058, and feature_015 in tested marginal and marker-marker contexts, as well as several binary screens whose estimates were near zero or incompatible with the 0.15-unit threshold. The exact continuous comparisons for feature_038, feature_018, feature_036, and feature_040 remain methodological invalidities, not negative evidence. Remaining uncertainty concerns whether the three strong flags are separable/additive, overlapping manifestations of latent structure, or configuration-dependent; formal interaction tests and high-log-PFS contrasts are the most informative next analyses. All conclusions are associations in the supplied data, not causal effects or externally generalizable claims.",
  "research_notes": "Iteration 3 synthesize: H43 independently validated and exact marginal investigation closed. H27 exact marginal investigation closed after validation. Current robust accepted associations: H27 feature_002=1 higher; H43 feature_010=1 higher; H44 feature_037=1 lower, still awaiting validation. Conditional robustness strongly supports persistence in other-flag complements and feature_038 high stratum. Next analyze priority: H57-H65 formal interactions/additivity among feature_002/feature_010/feature_037 and feature_038 context, plus H55-H56/H69 high feature_040 contexts and H68 residual feature_003 screen. If interactions are near zero, describe the three as separable dataset-specific associations; if exceed threshold, revise interpretation to configuration-dependent associations. Request validation for H44 at next appraise if still appropriate. Interpretations remain dataset-specific and noncausal."
